  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Organisation Strategy for the CGIAR Partnership 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark will contribute to CGIAR achieving its goals in the Strategy 2030 within the overall objective to encourage and enable a green food systems transformation in the context of climate change,
taking the challenges of climate change adaptation and mitigation (reducing GHG emissions) fully on board.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CGIAR is a world leader in agricultural science and innovation for development addressing the intertwined health, environment, and social inclusion challenges of the 21st. century. The CGIAR 2030 Research and Innovation Strategy presents the vision and mission of the organisation in transforming food, land and water systems in a climate crisis. For more information go to: https://www.cgiar.org/how-we-work/strategy/</narrative>
  </description>
